{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しでバースデーライブ。\n乃木坂46。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46生駒里奈 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しでお誕生日をむかえるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2歳になるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間でみるとまだ赤ちゃんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2年間はこかったな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今いろいろ横アリにむけてやってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく不安。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもただの不安じゃないのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ココロの中でいろんな感情が波打っているの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが血液を通して伝わっているの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この感情をお誕生日当日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで楽しくて面白くてそんな輝いたものにしたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様歌います。\nソロ曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時はお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場を水色のサイリウムでいっぱいにして欲しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色きれいでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『16歳〜』ってあるんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳になった私が。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳の私よりどう変わったのか、変わらないのかみれるんじゃないかなっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばん緊張しそうねっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(〃艸〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/02/20/0512718/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KERA今月表紙ですっ！\nありがたき幸せ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKIRA様も見てくださったみたいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん、ななみん、まりっかお誕生日おめでとうございますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真また撮ろうね〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この辺でばいばいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ。\n楽しみ不安っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}